  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/33c90075-5a9a-4d5a-b033-0d7dac1f8ed7.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>4 fotos del campionat de front&oacute; a m&agrave; per parelles, en el qual s&#39;han imposat Jordi de Massamagrell i Pepe d&#39;Albuixec 22-18 a Pedro i Diego L&oacute;pez d&#39;Onda, i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/IMG_2942.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>128 imatges del&nbsp;Festival de l&rsquo;Associaci&oacute; Art&iacute;stica i Juvenil de Suera a benefici de la Iniciativa solid&agrave;ria Pintant el cam&iacute; de Rosa.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengesetmanaculturaluera17/33c90075-5a9a-4d5a-b033-0d7dac1f8ed7.jpg\" alt=\"33c90075-5a9a-4d5a-b033-0d7dac1f8ed7\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengesetmanaculturaluera17/c8933c5a-3568-4d5f-b70b-a5e35ea42466.jpg\" alt=\"c8933c5a-3568-4d5f-b70b-a5e35ea42466\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengesetmanaculturaluera17/ee3ba0dd-5f82-4dd4-82a5-d3e11b3f8c32.jpg\" alt=\"ee3ba0dd-5f82-4dd4-82a5-d3e11b3f8c32\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengesetmanaculturaluera17/f50faafa-fd2a-48cf-9d3e-e93fe3ef2e9d.jpg\" alt=\"f50faafa-fd2a-48cf-9d3e-e93fe3ef2e9d\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengesetmanaculturaluera17/img_2793.jpg\" alt=\"img_2793\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengesetmanaculturaluera17/img_2795.jpg\" alt=\"img_2795\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:a